- Line 1: `one two three four`
- Line 2: `five six seven`
- Cursor at line 1, col 0 (on `o` in `one`)

Keys: `w`

**after_action.png** (after):
- Cursor at line 1, col 4 (on `t` in `two`, start of second word)
- No text change

END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('w');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_action');
    },
}
